   },
   "why": {
    "correct": "ΔK = ½(1200 kg)(20. m/s)² = 2.4 × 10⁵ J. P = ΔK/Δt = 2.4 × 10⁵ J / 8.0 s = 3.0 × 10⁴ W."
   }
